"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 25.24,
"end": 30.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And that connects to what we are discussing today.",
"char_start": 546,
"char_end": 596,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 30.0,
"end": 36.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I'd like to point something out – Stefan Brandt mentioned a similar dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 611,
"char_end": 706,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 36.0,
"end": 38.5,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Can you give me a specific example?",
"char_start": 707,
"char_end": 742,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 38.5,
"end": 42.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 743,
"char_end": 792,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 42.0,
"end": 44.98,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "To be honest, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 807,
"char_end": 903,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 44.98,
"end": 46.38,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 904,
"char_end": 949,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 46.38,
"end": 48.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 950,
"char_end": 1002,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 48.0,
"end": 50.41,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1017,
"char_end": 1050,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 50.41,
"end": 54.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 1051,
"char_end": 1100,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 54.0,
"end": 54.31,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1115,
"char_end": 1125,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 54.31,
"end": 57.56,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a small adjustment to the suspension.",
"char_start": 1126,
"char_end": 1230,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 57.56,
"end": 60.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The context is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 1231,
"char_end": 1309,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 60.0,
"end": 61.61,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1324,
"char_end": 1342,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 61.61,
"end": 66.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 1343,
"char_end": 1392,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 66.0,
"end": 69.05,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "To be honest, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes you can survive.",
"char_start": 1407,
"char_end": 1527,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 69.05,
"end": 70.17,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1528,
"char_end": 1572,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 70.17,
"end": 72.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll have to rebuild it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1573,
"char_end": 1645,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 72.0,
"end": 78.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where does it break down?",
"char_start": 1660,
"char_end": 1685,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 78.0,
"end": 81.21,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly visible.",
"char_start": 1700,
"char_end": 1776,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 81.21,
"end": 84.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that most people overlook.",
"char_start": 1777,
"char_end": 1843,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 84.0,
"end": 87.7,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the heuristic (or guiding principle) that you always come back to?",
"char_start": 1858,
"char_end": 1932,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 87.7,
"end": 90.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1933,
"char_end": 1979,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 90.0,
"end": 90.67,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1994,
"char_end": 2014,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 90.67,
"end": 93.81,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Erosion patterns on the track sections change the line choices between training and race day.",
"char_start": 2015,
"char_end": 2108,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 93.81,
"end": 96.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Once you understand that, the other decisions will become easier.",
"char_start": 2109,
"char_end": 2174,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 96.0,
"end": 100.36,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Before we continue, please support this podcast and visit the website of our sponsor.",
"char_start": 2189,
