"char_end": 5095,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 223.18,
"end": 225.61,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 5096,
"char_end": 5201,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 225.61,
"end": 226.8,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 5202,
"char_end": 5253,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 226.8,
"end": 228.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5254,
"char_end": 5306,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s04"
},
{
"start": 228.0,
"end": 234.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "That fits.\nThat works.\nThat's perfect.\nThat's right.\nThat's a good fit.",
"char_start": 5321,
"char_end": 5392,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 234.0,
"end": 240.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And when teams adopt the Spoke & Wrench process, the compromise becomes apparent – I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5407,
"char_end": 5542,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 240.0,
"end": 242.86,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always fall back on?",
"char_start": 5557,
"char_end": 5608,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 242.86,
"end": 246.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
"char_start": 5609,
"char_end": 5665,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 246.0,
"end": 246.72,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 5680,
"char_end": 5700,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 246.72,
"end": 250.06,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Erosion patterns on the track sections change the line choices between training and race day.",
"char_start": 5701,
"char_end": 5794,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 250.06,
"end": 252.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I have observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5795,
"char_end": 5849,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s03"
},
{
"start": 252.0,
"end": 258.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Before we wrap up, is there one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 5864,
"char_end": 5939,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 258.0,
"end": 262.53,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 5954,
"char_end": 6022,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 262.53,
"end": 264.0,
